menu "Glance Weather"

    config GLANCE_CWA_API_KEY
        string "CWA open data API key"
        default ""
        help
            Authorization key from opendata.cwa.gov.tw (member page). Treat
            it as a secret. Leave empty to show no weather. Local to sdkconfig
            (gitignored) until provisioning (M7) replaces this.

    config GLANCE_WEATHER_LOCATION
        string "County or city"
        default ""
        help
            Exactly as CWA writes it, e.g. 臺北市 or 新竹縣 (臺, not 台).

endmenu
